The district is divided into 3 revenue divisions: [[Eluru revenue division|Eluru]], [[Jangareddygudem revenue division|Jangareddygudem]], and [[Nuzividu revenue division|Nuzividu]], which are further subdivided into a total of 27 mandals, each headed by a sub-collector.<ref name="sakshi-1"/><ref name="restructure-2023"/>

